{"id":"j18fhcpdfkrczdcl7xsr0gsut","title":"胆汁酸：连接肠肝的“信使”，高了低了都要关注","originalTitle":"[转载]胆汁酸：连接肠肝的“信使”，高了低了都要关注","summary":"胆汁酸不仅是消化脂肪的洗涤剂，还是激素和信号分子，调控糖脂代谢、能量消耗和免疫反应。肠道菌群通过多种酶改造胆汁酸，影响其结构和功能，进而影响胆汁酸的吸收与代谢。胆汁酸水平异常可导致脂肪泻、小肠细菌过度生长和腹泻等消化吸收问题。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=2040048&do=blog&id=1560815"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T05:52:51.381Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T05:52:51.381Z","category":"life-science","tags":["研究成果"],"score":32,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}